    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que calcula el costo económico total de un episodio de tratamiento farmacológico (drug_era) agregando los costos de las dispensaciones que lo integran:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    de.drug_era_id,\n    de.person_id,\n    de.drug_concept_id,\n    SUM(c.total_charge) AS total_economic_cost_era\nFROM\n    `drug_era` AS de\nJOIN\n    `drug_exposure` AS dex\n    ON de.person_id = dex.person_id\n    AND dex.drug_exposure_start_date >= de.drug_era_start_date\n    AND dex.drug_exposure_end_date <= de.drug_era_end_date\nJOIN\n    `cost` AS c\n    ON dex.drug_exposure_id = c.cost_event_id\n    AND c.cost_domain_id = 'Drug'\nGROUP BY\n    de.drug_era_id,\n    de.person_id,\n    de.drug_concept_id\n```",
            "thoughtSignature": "CosCAY89a19WQvIZzjatB2zuclyy34SqdwHJszsi4UGf9ZKzPyKDp4vkeSi-i7CIiB1U6-xLyAQ0IXkmegJJmh8PeYhO0ubv3URPqygcRxMrQNJW2GWZlIgsCrv8AXMD4N2HTlbmrjMoZwXkS30x4JgRPRgmIPUDRArjgRAlIsQeLL44MsofY9GO_u8GRwLGAMmWS_tZjFWcvi4tKraB28TWvngj80-BEsVvEBL8o1yGb8mBFUhIOzGFI56mHA5voRgR6o38s1pMTEqeb_9Dbpp7SxKgWglLu0nQQeDi7kNanKkqEA67XLqiqP6yj6YzipXoWzu04F_ZbdRB9FwBbjqLHgQfjDgMlnPcunQR"
